  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n (x²-3x+2)/(x²-4)\n\n⇒ (x² - 2x - x + 2)/{(x - 2)(x + 2)}\n\n⇒ x(x - 2) - 1(x - 2)/{(x - 2)(x + 2)}\n\n⇒ (x - 2)(x - 1)/{(x - 2)(x + 2)}\n\n⇒ (x - 1)/(x + 2)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is (x-1)/(x+2).**",
